# Freemium

- Free is the real product: **2 drafts**, full editor, share/print, PDF **with watermark**.
- Do not block Print on free. Gate copy: “В PDF будет метка free” → Печатать с меткой | Донат / поддержать. Optional: Pro $1 / мес (99 ₽) to drop the watermark.
- **Primary CTA is donate / поддержать** — no obligation, “скинуть столько, сколько инструмент сэкономил”.
- Optional symbolic Pro is **$1 / мес (99 ₽)**. Frame it as support, not SaaS. Do not lead with 990 ₽/мес or 2490 ₽ lifetime.
- Pro unlocks: unlimited drafts + no watermark. Entitlement is stored in `localStorage` only after **server-verified** redeem (`POST /api/license/redeem`).
- Keep prices, offer ids, donate/pro mailto helpers, and env URL hooks in `src/lib/plan.ts`. Do not hardcode a different limit or price.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
saveDraft(createProposal()); // even when 2 drafts already exist on free

// ✅ GOOD
if (!canCreateDraft()) return;
const next = saveDraft(createProposal());
```
